WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640
Apply the decision rules in order. A
breached quality or authority floor holds

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:09.080
the workflow. Missing baseline
or review evidence remains unknown.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.680
Only then examine the proposed saving,

00:00:11.751 --> 00:00:15.200
adoption and cost criteria
for a limited scope.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.680
Borderline results can justify a bounded
redesign with one clear hypothesis.

00:00:19.813 --> 00:00:24.080
These are the example pilot's rules,
not a universal benchmark.

00:00:24.136 --> 00:00:28.000
Financial claims still need the agreed
capture and validation process.
